From: Casa Primera Fix Bot <fix-bot@casa-primera.local>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 10:10:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make rate packages clickable and pre-fill Reserve form from
 selection

- RatesSection: every package card (across all villas) is now clickable
  and keyboard-accessible. Clicking a card highlights it in blue and
  clears the previous selection; the first package is highlighted by
  default when a villa is opened, matching the prior look.
- Added a ReservationSelectionProvider (React context) shared between
  RatesSection and BookingCTA so a chosen villa+package can be handed
  off between the two sections, which are otherwise unrelated siblings
  on the same page.
- Clicking 'Reserve This Villa' in the Rates section now pushes the
  active villa and a guest count representative of the selected
  package into that shared context.
- BookingCTA reads that selection and pre-fills the 'Selected Villa'
  and 'Guests' fields as soon as the guest scrolls down to the Reserve
  Now form, instead of leaving them blank/defaulted.
- Added a paxUpperBound() helper to translate a package's pax range
  (e.g. '26-30 pax') into a concrete guest count for the booking form.
